    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="46.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 46.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Yfel bið hit þæt man fæstentide ær mæle éte, ⁊ gyt hit bið wyrse þæt man mid flæscmete hine sylfne gefyle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is wrong for anyone during a fast to eat before the appointed time, and it is still worse for anyone to defile himself with flesh.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Yfel byð, þæt man rihtfæstentide ær mæle ete, ⁊ gyt wyrse, þæt man mid flæscmete hine sylfne gefyle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
